{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105907","id":2489011223,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6UW0wX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105907","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105907.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105907.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105907","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105907/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105907/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105907/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8ba4656ea39dc2dcba00edd8e93718703d5363ca","number":105907,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Compile out editor-only logic within  `_validate_property` in export template","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Addresses #103357.\r\nWraps editor-only logic in `validate_property` with `Engine::get_singleton()->is_editor_hint()` or\r\n```cpp\r\nif (!Engine::get_singleton()->is_editor_hint()) {\r\n    return;\r\n}\r\n``` \r\nto make it only run in the editor (mainly `PROPERTY_USAGE_NO_EDITOR` `PROPERTY_USAGE_READ_ONLY` and property hint ,except `PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE`, `PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE`). \r\nThis speeds up `Object.get_property_list` `Resource.duplicate`  and `Node.duplicate` for certain classes that do many string comparisons in validate property, and should also speed up scene loading.\r\n\r\nBenchmark:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar m := StandardMaterial3D.new()\r\n\tvar e := Environment.new()\r\n\r\n\tvar t := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\tm.duplicate()\r\n\tvar t1 := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\r\n\tprint(t1 - t)\r\n\r\n\tt = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\te.duplicate()\r\n\tt1 = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\r\n\tprint(t1 - t)\r\n\r\n\tt = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\tm.get_property_list()\r\n\tt1 = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\r\n\tprint(t1 - t)\r\n\r\n\tt = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\te.get_property_list()\r\n\tt1 = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\r\n\tprint(t1 - t)\r\n```\r\nEdit: \r\nIn editor:    200 105 452 360\r\nIn game:\r\nbefore:    124 107 241 217   \r\nafter:         57 34 186 132","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name"